  "notes": "{考察|こうさつ} means thoughtful analysis or examination - careful consideration of a subject from multiple angles.\n\nGRAMMAR:\nUsed as a noun or する verb ({考察|こうさつ}する = to examine/analyze).\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {考察|こうさつ}する: to examine, analyze\n- {考察|こうさつ}を{加|くわ}える: to add analysis\n- {考察|こうさつ}を{深|ふか}める: to deepen analysis\n- 〜について{考察|こうさつ}する: to examine/consider ~\n\nUSAGE:\nPrimarily used in academic, research, and formal contexts. Common in:\n- {論文|ろんぶん} (academic papers)\n- レポート (reports)\n- {研究|けんきゅう} (research)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {考察|こうさつ}: in-depth analysis (formal)\n- {検討|けんとう}: examination, review (practical)\n- {分析|ぶんせき}: analysis (systematic breakdown)",
